THIRD-PARTY LICENSES — quatm
=============================

quatm does not vendor any third-party source code. All runtime and build
dependencies are installed via pip as separate wheels, each of which
carries its own license text in your site-packages directory. This file
consolidates the notice required for redistribution and identifies where
each license text can be found.

One exception is documented in section 2b: the GUI icon set is bundled as
SVG assets (Font Awesome Free, CC BY 4.0 — attribution below).

quatm 不捆绑任何第三方源码。全部运行/构建依赖均通过 pip 以独立 wheel
安装，各自 wheel 自带许可文本（位于你的 site-packages 目录）。本文件
汇总再分发所需声明，并给出各许可文本的获取位置。

唯一例外见 2b 节：界面图标集以 SVG 资源形式随包分发（Font Awesome
Free，CC BY 4.0，归属声明见下）。

For each dependency: name — SPDX license — where to find the text.
每个依赖：名称 — SPDX 许可 — 许可文本位置。

